{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56352","headline":"恺悌诗（幷序） 惠风二章（一章十二句，一章八句）（惠风，民被赐也。） 二 · 孙宗闵","name":"恺悌诗（幷序） 惠风二章（一章十二句，一章八句）（惠风，民被赐也。） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猎野班春，苏萌润坼。\n腾茂英英，扬光赫赫。\n福介羣黎，欢飞广陌。\n敢继周诗，式歌召伯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙宗闵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}